# Prototype 1's first problem.
#
# The plant is real and the numbers are guesses. That asymmetry is the point:
# a scenario file is a rules file, it is meant to be edited between playtests,
# and nothing in it can reach the solver.

scenario First Gears {
    plant   p1-gears.factory
    brief   The works are underbuilt in two places. Only one of them has a queue in front of it.

    budget  1000

    cost process 120 each
    cost link    60  per vehicle
    cost storage 40  per 1000 capacity
    cost source  200 each
    cost sink    80  each
    cost wire    5   each

    order deliver 12000 Gear by 60000
}
